<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/"><channel><title>Said &amp; Checked: Defense and National Security &#8212; AskAmerica</title><link>https://askamerica.ai/studies/said-and-checked-archive/</link><atom:link href="https://askamerica.ai/studies/said-and-checked-feeds/defense-and-national-security.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><description>What officeholders said each day about Defense and National Security, and which statements government data supports, contradicts or rules out.</description><language>en-us</language><item><title>Said &amp; Checked, Defense and National Security, 2026-11-18: none false or contradicted</title><link>https://askamerica.ai/studies/said-and-checked-2026-11-18/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://askamerica.ai/studies/said-and-checked-2026-11-18/#topic-defense-and-national-security</guid><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 17:00:00 +0000</pubDate><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://askamerica.ai/studies/said-and-checked-2026-11-18/"&gt;&lt;img src="https://askamerica.ai/studies/said-and-checked-feeds/img/defense-and-national-security/2026-11-18.png" alt="Said &amp;amp; Checked 2026-11-18, Defense and National Security: 0 checked · 5 not yet checked · 2 not checkable" width="600" height="315"/&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;No statement was found false or contradicted.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;7 statements by 5 officeholders. 0 checked &amp;middot; 5 not yet checked &amp;middot; 2 not checkable.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://askamerica.ai/studies/said-and-checked-2026-11-18/"&gt;Read every statement and how each was checked&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><media:content url="https://askamerica.ai/studies/said-and-checked-feeds/img/defense-and-national-security/2026-11-18.png" medium="image" type="image/png" width="1200" height="630"/></item><item><title>Said &amp; Checked, Defense and National Security, 2026-11-17: none false or contradicted, 1 unsettled (Donald Trump)</title><link>https://askamerica.ai/studies/said-and-checked-2026-11-17/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://askamerica.ai/studies/said-and-checked-2026-11-17/#topic-defense-and-national-security</guid><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 17:00:00 +0000</pubDate><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://askamerica.ai/studies/said-and-checked-2026-11-17/"&gt;&lt;img src="https://askamerica.ai/studies/said-and-checked-feeds/img/defense-and-national-security/2026-11-17.png" alt="Said &amp;amp; Checked 2026-11-17, Defense and National Security: 1 checked: 1 unsettled · 1 not checkable" width="600" height="315"/&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;No statement was found false or contradicted.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unsettled&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Donald Trump&lt;/strong&gt;, President of the United States: &amp;ldquo;Nobody&amp;#x27;s proven that she&amp;#x27;s a spy.&amp;rdquo; &lt;em&gt;Unsettled.&lt;/em&gt; No charge or court filing against the woman was found. AP relays a New York Times report that U.S. intelligence concluded she was a Chinese agent; that conclusion is unpublished and could not be read directly, so whether an official finding exists is not settled.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;2 statements by 1 officeholder. 1 checked: 1 unsettled &amp;middot; 1 not checkable.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://askamerica.ai/studies/said-and-checked-2026-11-17/"&gt;Read every statement and how each was checked&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><media:content url="https://askamerica.ai/studies/said-and-checked-feeds/img/defense-and-national-security/2026-11-17.png" medium="image" type="image/png" width="1200" height="630"/></item><item><title>Said &amp; Checked, Defense and National Security, 2026-11-15: none false or contradicted</title><link>https://askamerica.ai/studies/said-and-checked-2026-11-15/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://askamerica.ai/studies/said-and-checked-2026-11-15/#topic-defense-and-national-security</guid><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 17:00:00 +0000</pubDate><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://askamerica.ai/studies/said-and-checked-2026-11-15/"&gt;&lt;img src="https://askamerica.ai/studies/said-and-checked-feeds/img/defense-and-national-security/2026-11-15.png" alt="Said &amp;amp; Checked 2026-11-15, Defense and National Security: 2 checked: 2 supported · 0 not checkable" width="600" height="315"/&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;No statement was found false or contradicted.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;2 statements by 2 officeholders. 2 checked: 2 supported &amp;middot; 0 not checkable.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://askamerica.ai/studies/said-and-checked-2026-11-15/"&gt;Read every statement and how each was checked&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><media:content url="https://askamerica.ai/studies/said-and-checked-feeds/img/defense-and-national-security/2026-11-15.png" medium="image" type="image/png" width="1200" height="630"/></item></channel></rss>
